<h1>Security &amp; compliance overview</h1>
<p>How Godzilla protects data moving through your <a href="/concepts-pipelines">pipelines</a>.</p>

<h2>Encryption</h2>
<p>All API traffic requires TLS 1.2+. Connector credentials are encrypted at rest and are never returned in full by any endpoint after creation.</
